Would you like to discuss specific medical research areas or emerging healthcare technologies?"}

{"conversation_id":"291d4d67-dcf7-4d57-9606-401ab1e30bb4","response":"I have no personal opinions, but I can provide a balanced, objective assessment. Nuclear energy represents a complex technological approach to energy generation. While it offers significant advantages—including reliable baseload power generation and relatively low greenhouse gas emissions during operation—the technology also introduces critical safety and regulatory considerations.

